{"id":"ch35","number":"34","title":"標準存取控制清單","en":"Standard ACLs","start":226,"end":231,"domain":"security","topics":["acl","standard-acl"],"scope":"core","order":35,"pages":[{"page":226,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0226.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"34. STANDARD ACCESS CONTROL LISTS (ACL)","source":"text","id":"p226-b1","segments":[{"en":"34.","zh":"34.","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"STANDARD ACCESS CONTROL LISTS (ACL)","zh":"標準 存取控制清單 (ACL)","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"34.\n標準 存取控制清單 (ACL)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"WHAT ARE ACLs","source":"text","id":"p226-b2","segments":[{"en":"WHAT ARE ACLs","zh":"ACLs是怎樣的?","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"ACLs是怎樣的?","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nACLs (Access Control Lists) have multiple uses \n• \nIn DAY 34 and DAY 35, we will focus on ACL’s from a security perspective \n• \nACLs function as a “packet filter” - instructing the ROUTER to ALLOW or DENY specific traffic \n• \nACLs can filter traffic based on:","source":"text","id":"p226-b3","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"ACLs (Access Control Lists) have multiple uses","zh":"空調(存取控制清單)有多種用途","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"In DAY 34 and DAY 35, we will focus on ACL’s from a security perspective","zh":"在白天34和白天35,我們將從安全的角度著重討論ACL的問題。","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"ACLs function as a “packet filter” - instructing the ROUTER to ALLOW or DENY specific traffic","zh":"A. 碳酸酯作為“一個”的功能封包過濾器” - 指示路由器* 允許或拒絕特定交通","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"ACLs can filter traffic based on:","zh":"ACLs可以基於下列內容過濾流量:","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n空調(存取控制清單)有多種用途\n•\n在白天34和白天35,我們將從安全的角度著重討論ACL的問題。\n•\nA. 碳酸酯作為“一個”的功能封包過濾器” - 指示路由器* 允許或拒絕特定交通\n•\nACLs可以基於下列內容過濾流量:","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nSOURCE / DESTINATION IP ADDRESSES \no \nSOURCE / DESTINATION LAYER 4 PORTS \no \netc.","source":"text","id":"p226-b4","segments":[{"en"