"kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nHosts in 192.168.1.0/24 should have ACCESS to the 10.0.1.0/24 NETWORK \n• \nHosts in 192.168.2.0/24 should not have ACCESS to the 10.0.10/24 NETWORK \nACLs are configured GLOBALLY on the ROUTER (Global Config Mode)","source":"text","id":"p226-b29","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Hosts in 192.168.1.0/24 should have ACCESS to the 10.0.1.0/24 NETWORK","zh":"192.168.1.0/24中的主機應能夠進入10.0.1.0/24網路","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Hosts in 192.168.2.0/24 should not have ACCESS to the 10.0.10/24 NETWORK ACLs are configured GLOBALLY on the ROUTER (Global Config Mode)","zh":"主機內192.168.2.0/24不應進入10.0.10/24網路控制列表在全球配置路由器(全球配置模式)","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"•\n192.168.1.0/24中的主機應能夠進入10.0.1.0/24網路\n•\n主機內192.168.2.0/24不應進入10.0.10/24網路控制列表在全球配置路由器(全球配置模式)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nThey are an ordered sequence of ACEs (Access Control Entries)","source":"text","id":"p226-b30","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"They are an ordered sequence of ACEs (Access Control Entries)","zh":"它們是 ACE 的順序( 訪問控制項)","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n它們是 ACE 的順序( 訪問控制項)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"ACL 1:","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b31","segments":[{"en":"ACL 1:","zh":"ACL1:","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"ACL1:","kind":"prose"},{"en":"1: if source IP","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b32","segments":[{"en":"1: if source IP","zh":"1:如果來源IP","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"1:如果來源IP","kind":"prose"},{"en":"= 192.168.1.0/24,","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b33","segments":[{"en":"= 192.168.1.0/24,","zh":"= 192.168.1.0/24,","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"= 192.168.1.0/24,","kind":"code"},{"en":"then permit","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b34","segments":[{"en":"then permit","zh":"然後允許","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"然後允許","kind":"prose"},{"en":"2: if source IP","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b35","segments":[{"en":"2: if source IP","zh":"2:如果來源IP","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"2:如果來源IP","kind":"prose"},{"en":"- 192.168.2.0/24,","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b36","segments":[{"en":"- 192.168.2.0/24,","zh":"- 192.168.2.0/24,","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"- 192.168.2.0/24,","kind":"code"},{"en":"then deny","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b37","segments":[{"en":"then deny","zh":"然後否認,","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"然後否認,","kind":"prose"},{"en":"3: if source IP = any, then permit","source":"image-ocr","id":"p226-b38","segments":[{"en":"3: if source IP = any, then permit","zh":"3:如果來源IP=任何,則允許","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"3:如果來源IP=任何,則允許","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nConfiguring an ACL in Global Config Mode will not make the ACL take effect \n• \nThe ACL must be applied to an interface","source":"text","id":"p226-b39","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Configuring an ACL in Global Config Mode will not make the ACL take effect","zh":"在“全球配置模式”中配置ACL不會使ACL生效","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The ACL must be applied to an interface","zh":"ACL必須適用於介面","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"•\n在“全球配置模式”中配置ACL不會使ACL生效\n•\nACL必須適用於介面","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nACLs are applied either INBOUND or OUTBOUND \n• \nACLs are made up of one or more ACEs \n• \nWhen a ROUTER checks a PACKET against the ACL, it processes the ACEs in order, from top to \nbottom \n• \nIf the PACKET matches one of the ACEs in the ACL, the ROUTER takes the action and stops \nprocessing the ACL. All entries below the matching entry will be ignored","source":"text","id":"p226-b40","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"ACLs are applied either INBOUND or OUTBOUND","zh":"適用入境或出境控制清單","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"ACLs are made up of one or more ACEs","zh":"ACL由一個或多個ACE組成","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"When a ROUTER checks a PACKET against the ACL, it processes the ACEs in order, from top to bottom","zh":"當一個路由器對照ACL檢查一個封包時,它會按順序從上到下處理ACE","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"If the PACKET matches one of the ACEs in the ACL, the ROUTER takes the action and stops processing the ACL.","zh":"如果封包與ACL中的ACE之一相匹配,則路由器採取動作並停止處理ACL.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"All entries below the matching entry will be ignored","zh":"匹配條目下方的所有條目將被忽略","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"零 級\n適用入境或出境控制清單\n•\nACL由一個或多個ACE組成\n•\n當一個路由器對照ACL檢查一個封包時,它會按順序從上到下處理ACE\n•\n如果封包與ACL中的ACE之一相匹配,則路由器採取動作並停止處理ACL.\n匹配條目下方的所有條目將被忽略","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":227,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0227.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"ACL 2:","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b1","segments":[{"en":"ACL 2:","zh":"ACL2:","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"ACL2:","kind":"prose"},{"en":"1: if source IP =","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b2","segments":[{"en":"1: if source IP =","zh":"1:如果來源IP=","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"1:如果來源IP=","kind":"prose"},{"en":"192.168.1.0/24,","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b3","segments":[{"en":"192.168.1.0/24,","zh":"192.168.1.0/24,","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"192.168.1.0/24,","kind":"code"},{"en":"hen permit","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b4","segments":[{"en":"hen permit","zh":"母雞許可","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"母雞許可","kind":"prose"},{"en":"2: if source IP =","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b5","segments":[{"en":"2: if source IP =","zh":"2:如果來源IP=","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"2:如果來源IP=","kind":"prose"},{"en":"192.168.0.0/16,","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b6","segments":[{"en":"192.168.0.0/16,","zh":"192.168.0.0/16,","method":"verbatim"}],"zh":"192.168.0.0/16,","kind":"code"},{"en":"then deny","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b7","segments":[{"en":"then deny","zh":"然後否認,","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"然後否認,","kind":"prose"},{"en":"A maximum of one ACL can be applied","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b8","segments":[{"en":"A maximum of one ACL can be applied","zh":"最多可適用一個ACL","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"最多可適用一個ACL","kind":"prose"},{"en":"to a single interface per direction.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b9","segments":[{"en":"to a single interface per direction.","zh":"至一個介面,每個方向。","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"至一個介面,每個方向。","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Inbound: Maximum one ACL","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b10","segments":[{"en":"Inbound: Maximum one ACL","zh":"輸入:最大值 ACL","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"輸入:最大值 ACL","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Outbound: Maximum one ACL","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b11","segments":[{"en":"Outbound: Maximum one ACL","zh":"出局:最大值 ACL","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"出局:最大值 ACL","kind":"prose"},{"en":"IMPLICIT DENY","source":"text","id":"p227-b12","segments":[{"en":"IMPLICIT DENY","zh":"默示否認","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"默示否認","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nWhat will happen if a PACKET doesn’t match any of the entries in an ACL ? \n• \nThere is an INPLICIT DENY at the end of ALL ACL’s \n• \nThe IMPLICIT DENY tells the ROUTER to DENY ALL TRAFFIC that doesn’t match ANY of the \nconfigured entries in the ACL","source":"text","id":"p227-b13","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"What will happen if a PACKET doesn’t match any of the entries in an ACL ?","zh":"如果一個封包與ACL中的任何條目不相匹配,將會發生什麼?","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"There is an INPLICIT DENY at the end of ALL ACL’s","zh":"終究有不合法的否認ACL’s","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The IMPLICIT DENY tells the ROUTER to DENY ALL TRAFFIC that doesn’t match ANY of the configured entries in the ACL","zh":"隱含的否認告訴路由器拒絕所有與ACL中配置的條目不匹配的流量","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n如果一個封包與ACL中的任何條目不相匹配,將會發生什麼?\n•\n終究有不合法的否認ACL’s\n•\n隱含的否認告訴路由器拒絕所有與ACL中配置的條目不匹配的流量","kind":"prose"},{"en":"ACL TYPES","source":"text","id":"p227-b14","segments":[{"en":"ACL TYPES","zh":"ACL型別","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"ACL型別","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• Standard ACLs: Match based on Source IP address","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b15","segments":[{"en":"• Standard ACLs: Match based on Source IP address","zh":"• 標準ACLs:基於來源IP address的匹配","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"• 標準ACLs:基於來源IP address的匹配","kind":"prose"},{"en":"— Standard Numbered ACLs","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b16","segments":[{"en":"— Standard Numbered ACLs","zh":"——標準編號的空調","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"——標準編號的空調","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Standard Named ACLs","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b17","segments":[{"en":"Standard Named ACLs","zh":"標準命名的 ACLs","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"標準命名的 ACLs","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• Extended ACLs: Match based on Source/Destination IP, Source/Destination port, etc.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b18","segments":[{"en":"• Extended ACLs: Match based on Source/Destination IP, Source/Destination port, etc.","zh":"• 擴充套件ACLs:基於來源/目的端IP,來源/目的端埠等的匹配.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"• 擴充套件ACLs:基於來源/目的端IP,來源/目的端埠等的匹配.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"— Extended Numbered ACLs","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b19","segments":[{"en":"— Extended Numbered ACLs","zh":"— 擴充套件編號的ACLs","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"— 擴充套件編號的ACLs","kind":"prose"},{"en":"— Extended Named ACLs","source":"image-ocr","id":"p227-b20","segments":[{"en":"— Extended Named ACLs","zh":"— 擴充套件命名的ACLs","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"— 擴充套件命名的ACLs","kind":"prose"},{"en":"STANDARD NUMBERED ACLs","source":"text","id":"p227-b21","segments":[{"en":"STANDARD NUMBERED ACLs","zh":"標準編號 ACLs","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"標準編號 ACLs","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nMatch traffic based only on the SOURCE IP ADDRESS of the PACKET \n• \nNumbered ACLs are identified with a number (ie: ACL 1, ACL 2, etc.) \n• \nDifferent TYPES of ACLs have a different range of numbers that can be used \n\n\n\n\n STANDARD ACLs can use 1-99 and 1300-1999","source":"text","id":"p227-b22","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Match traffic based only on the SOURCE IP ADDRESS of the PACKET","zh":"僅根據封包的來源IP address匹配流量","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Numbered ACLs are identified with a number (ie: ACL 1, ACL 2, etc.)","zh":"編號的ACL以數字表示(即:ACL1,ACL2等).","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"Different TYPES of ACLs have a different range of numbers that can be used STANDARD ACLs can use 1-99 and 1300-1999","zh":"不同型別的ACL有不同的數字範圍,可以使用標準ACL.1-99財務報告和已審計財務報表1300-1999","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"•\n僅根據封包的來源IP address匹配流量\n•\n編號的ACL以數字表示(即:ACL1,ACL2等).\n•\n不同型別的ACL有不同的數字範圍,可以使用標準ACL.1-99財務報告和已審計財務報表1300-1999","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nThe basic command to configure a STANDARD NUMBERED ACL","source":"text","id":"p227-b23","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The basic command to configure a STANDARD NUMBERED ACL","zh":"給 設定 一個標準編號 ACL 的基本命令","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n給 設定 一個標準編號 ACL 的基本命令","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nR1(config)# access-list *number* {deny | permit} *ip wildcard-mask* \nThis is an example of denying a SPECIFIC host’s traffic","source":"text","id":"p227-b24","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"R1(config)# access-list *number* {deny | permit} *ip wildcard-mask*","zh":"R1(config)# access-list *number* {deny | permit} *ip wildcard-mask*","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"This is an example of denying a SPECIFIC host’s traffic","zh":"這是拒絕特定主機交通的例子。","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"零 級\nR1(config)# access-list *number* {deny | permit} *ip wildcard-mask*\n這是拒絕特定主機交通的例子。","kind":"prose"}]},{"page":228,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0228.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"REMEMBER : 0.0.0.0 wildcard is the same as 255.255.255.255 or a /32 host","source":"text","id":"p228-b1","segments":[{"en":"REMEMBER : 0.0.0.0 wildcard is the same as 255.255.255.255 or a /32 host","zh":"記住:0.0.0.0萬用字元與255.255.255.255或一個/一個32 主機","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"記住:0.0.0.0萬用字元與255.255.255.255或一個/一個32 主機","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nExample : R1(config)# access-list 1 deny 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0 \no 